// Title: AVD scaling plans with time zone, schedules and host pool references
// Purpose: Check autoscale configuration of pooled host pools.
// Source table(s): Azure Resource Graph, resources (microsoft.desktopvirtualization/scalingplans)
// Parameters to edit: none.
// Notes/traps: schedules is a dynamic array (ramp-up, peak, ramp-down, off-peak), expand it for a per-phase table.
//          A scaling plan only takes effect on host pools listed in hostPoolReferences with scalingPlanEnabled = true.
resources
| where type =~ 'microsoft.desktopvirtualization/scalingplans'
| project name, resourceGroup, subscriptionId,
    timeZone = tostring(properties.timeZone),
    schedules = properties.schedules,
    hostPools = properties.hostPoolReferences
